SUMMARY:Gentle Yoga Flow: A Beginner Yoga Class
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a calming\, beginner-friendly yoga class designed to help you unwind\, stretch\, and move with ease. This all-levels session is perfect for anyone looking to build flexibility\, reduce stress\, and explore mindful movement in a welcoming environment. With over ten years' experience\, Hannah Cherry offers supportive guidance for every body. All are welcome— no prior yoga experience needed. Please wear comfortable clothes. There are a limited amount of yoga mats available\, but patrons are welcome to bring their own.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/gentle-yoga-flow%3a-a-beginner-yoga-class/25945/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventfallfestivalatmagnoliameadowfarms17423-20260926@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261031T154208Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260926
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261102
SUMMARY:Fall Festival at Magnolia Meadow Farms
DESCRIPTION:Your Fall Starts Here! Home to Maryland’s Largest Corn Maze\, we’re more than just a pumpkin patch! Located in beautiful Northern Frederick County\, just 1 hour west of Baltimore and 1.5 hours north of D.C. Come spend a day on the farm with something for everyone to enjoy! Maryland’s Largest Corn Maze with over 5 miles of trails\, PLUS: Famous Apple Cannons Hayrides to the Pumpkin Patch Farm Animal Interactions Gem Mining Mini Ziplines Jumping Pillow Mountain Slides Pedal Karts PICK-YOUR-OWN: Sunflowers Cut flowers and wildflowers Pumpkins in all shapes\, sizes\, & colors! GATHER: Share stories around a Private Campfire! Live entertainment every Saturday & Sunday! EAT: Enjoy a farm fresh meal with local beef\, pork\, and poultry! Freshly Made Apple Cider Donuts Freshly Made Kettle Corn Beer & Wine (21+\, ID required) SHOP: Pick up locally made products! Farm Fresh Honey Goat Milk Soap Baked Goods Magnolia Meadow Farms t-shirts\, sweatshirts\, & hats HOURS: September 26 - November 1 Saturdays: 10:00am to 8:00pm Sundays: 10:00am to 6:00pm Check our website for special days & hours!
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/fall-festival-at-magnolia-meadow-farms/17423/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventsummersfarmfallfestival12916-20260926@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261031T154208Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260926
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261102
SUMMARY:Summers Farm Fall Festival
DESCRIPTION:Join us for our annual Fall Festival at Summers Farm! For over 30 years\, Summers Farm has been the go-to destination for fall fun in Frederick County\, Maryland. With 45+ exciting activities\, there’s something for everyone to enjoy! Whether you're planning a day of family fun\, a corporate outing\, a school field trip\, an adventurous day date\, or just some good old-fashioned fun—Summers Farm is the place to be this fall! Here's what we have planned: Pumpkin Train Photo Ops Specialty Food & Drinks Famous Corn Maze Petting Zoo Wagon Rides Pedal Car Track Giant Slides Local Food Vendors 45+ Attractions & so much more! September 26 – November 1 September Sat – Sun: 10am – 7pm October 1 – 4 Thurs – Sun: 1pm – 7pm (Thurs)\, 1pm – 9pm (Fri)\, 10am – 9pm (Sat)\, 10am – 7pm (Sun) October 7 – 31 Wed – Thurs: 1pm – 7pm Fri: 1pm – 9pm Sat: 10am – 9pm Sun: 10am – 7pm November 1 (Sunday only) 10am – 7pm *October 12\, 16 & 26th – School Daze Craze: 11:30am – 9pm
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/summers-farm-fall-festival/12916/
END:VEVENT
