UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventcatoctinmountainhalloweenphotowalk26003-20261031@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261031T154208Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261031
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261101
SUMMARY:Catoctin Mountain Halloween Photo Walk
DESCRIPTION:Join a ranger for a leisurely\, early morning photo walk on Brown's Farm trail! The Brown's Farm trail is a short\, relatively flat 0.4 mile trail that includes extant structures of an Appalachian farmstead. Its quiet solitude and mix of natural and manmade features means there's something for everyone to capture. Bring something that can take photos\, good walking shoes\, and an urge to photograph the natural and historical world. The program will meet at 8am on October 31 at the Owens Creek Picnic Area.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/catoctin-mountain-halloween-photo-walk/26003/
END:VEVENT
