SUMMARY:Celebrate Halloween at JoJo's with Crash the Limo
DESCRIPTION:Killer costumes. Live music. A Halloween party worth crashing! Crash the Limo is taking over the Delirium Stage for a night of sing-along favorites\, wicked fun\, and Halloween mayhem at JoJo’s! Dress to impress—or frighten! The band will judge our costume contest for the sexiest\, funniest\, and scariest looks\, with JoJo’s gift cards\, JoJo’s swag\, band swag\, and treats up for grabs. Grab your crew\, fuel up with great food and drinks\, and come “Crash” the party. No cover!
