DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261101
SUMMARY:Halloween in Downtown Frederick
DESCRIPTION:Trick-or-treat in Downtown Frederick. Join us for a spook-tacular morning in Downtown Frederick! Bring the whole family for a fun and free Halloween celebration. October 31 | 10am – 12pm Wander the streets of Downtown Frederick and visit participating businesses handing out candy from 10am to noon. Stop by 30 N Market St for face painting\, hosted by Woodsboro Bank\, and add a little something extra to your costume. Free & Family-friendly. Costumes encouraged. Dress up and join the fun! Grab your candy bags and come celebrate Halloween in the heart of Downtown Frederick!
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/halloween-in-downtown-frederick/9127/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventhauntedhistoryhalloweennightatthenationalmuseumofcivilwarmedicine24070-20261031@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261031T154208Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261031
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261101
SUMMARY:Haunted History Halloween Night at the National Museum of Civil War Medicine
DESCRIPTION:Tour the most haunted building in Frederick – the National Museum of Civil War Medicine on HALLOWEEN NIGHT! Explore the building’s history amidst the darkened galleries and offices. On the tour\, staff and volunteers will share stories of Civil War embalmers\, the building’s most infamous tenants\, and their first-hand accounts of paranormal activity that have given the building its spooky reputation. In addition to a trip through the museum galleries\, the tour provides exclusive access to the third floor where numerous sightings have occurred. You are invited to bring your own cameras and ghost-finding apps – who knows what you’ll capture! Flash photography and LIVE streaming are prohibited. This year we are offering two special Halloween tours on Saturday\, October 31\, from 5:30 p.m.-8:00 p.m. and 8:00 p.m.-10:30 p.m. During these special Halloween night tours\, you’ll have additional time to tour the galleries without a guide.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/haunted-history-halloween-night-at-the-national-museum-of-civil-war-medicine/24070/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventjumbospumpkinpatchfallfestival11483-20261031@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261031T154208Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261031
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261101
SUMMARY:Jumbo's Pumpkin Patch Fall Festival
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the season with a full day of festive fun for all ages at Jumbo’s Pumpkin Patch! From classic farm adventures to fall-themed attractions\, our Fall Fun Festival is the perfect weekend outing for families\, friends\, and pumpkin lovers. What’s Included with Admission: Your ticket includes unlimited access to a variety of seasonal attractions: Hayrides through the farm 30+ acre u-pick pumpkin patch (pumpkins sold by the pound) Corn maze (14 acres) Petting zoo Jumping pillow Giant slides Mini mazes for younger guests Playgrounds and yard games General Store with fall shopping and décor​ Optional Add-Ons: (Available for Purchase Onsite - Saturday and Sunday Only) Enhance your day with these fun extras: Pony Rides – $7 Face Painting – $4 Sandy Candy (Edible Sand Art) – $4 Corn Cannon – $5 (3 shots) ​ Food & Drinks: Come hungry! A variety of food\, snacks\, and beverages are available for purchase\, including selections from Liquidity Ale Works of Mt. Airy. Tickets available online or at the gate.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/jumbos-pumpkin-patch-fall-festival/11483/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventmakeitmarket3ahalloweenedition26242-20261031@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261031T154208Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261031
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261101
SUMMARY:Make It Market: Halloween Edition
DESCRIPTION:Let's get spooky!! Fun for all ages\, costumes encouraged. Mini Workshop Stations Activities Photo back drop Light snacks & drinks Tricks & Treats The Make-It Market at Give Rise Studio is a unique\, hands-on experience for community members to create at different creative workshop stations. Handmade gifts from the heart to share with family and friends or keep for yourself. It's time to get spooky and nibble on some sweet treats. This vibrant event showcases talented local artisans offering interactive DIY stations where guests craft their own projects\, explore new skills\, and leave with personalized creations. Ranging from $8-10 and each station takes between 10-30 minutes. Set in a welcoming space\, the Make It Market is designed to celebrate local creativity\, bring people together\, and support the Frederick community. Make it\, take it\, and love it! Halloween themed stamped cards $10 Halloween themed paint kits $10 Complete and paint a wooden spider $8 Halloween inspired bracelets $8 Make it all pass - $40 Email me directly giverisestudio@gmail.com if you have any questions. Like and share this event and more information will come your way. Pre order your tickets or drop in!
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/make-it-market%3a-halloween-edition/26242/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventmurder26mayhemwalkingtour24084-20261031@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261031T154208Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261031
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261101
SUMMARY:Murder & Mayhem Walking Tour
DESCRIPTION:There’s plenty of ghost tours to be found this time of year\, but ours is spooky AND true! Delve into the true crime stories that haunt the streets of Frederick. From burglaries and brawls to bootlegging and bedaubing (vandalism)\, Frederick's history is full of all things macabre- and we’re here to share them with you! *This tour discusses violence and crime and is recommended for visitors age 12+*
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/murder-%26-mayhem-walking-tour/24084/
END:VEVENT
