SUMMARY:Myersville Farmers Market
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate local products\, fresh food\, and community at the Myersville Farmers Market! Explore seasonal fruits and vegetables\, fresh mushrooms\, meats eggs and cheeses\, baked goods\, local honey\, local spirits\, bath and body products\, locally made crafts\, and more! The purpose of these markets is to build community spirt and engagement\, as well as and to increase relationships between the artisans\, crafters\, and farmers with their customers.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/myersville-farmers-market/21730/
